      "access_roles": [
        "HR Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "28c160c7-c933-449e-a731-748b6ee201ec",
      "content": "Policy Maintenance\n\nEach HR policy should be reviewed at least annually. Changes must include a version number, effective date, owner, and summary of material changes.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002002",
      "document_id": "HR-ADMIN-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "HR Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "b7803c35-e3d5-4d1c-bc2e-fb29b03c7606",
      "content": "Access Notice\n\nThis document is restricted to HR Admin users. It contains internal HR operations guidance and should not be used as employee-facing policy language.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002002",
      "document_id": "HR-ADMIN-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "HR Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "9a6506b2-a6f0-45d7-934e-77e8608fddad",
      "content": "Employee-Facing Guidance\n\nHR Admins should keep employee-facing answers factual, policy-based, and free from legal conclusions. When a policy is unclear, the employee should be directed to People Operations instead of receiving speculative guidance.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002002",
      "document_id": "HR-ADMIN-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "HR Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "fa90b82b-0125-4233-b659-2881d28a2633",
      "content": "Policy Ownership\n\nPeople Operations owns the employee handbook, PTO and leave policy, benefits overview, and remote work policy. HR Admins are responsible for maintaining document versions, effective dates, and review cycles.\n\nPolicy updates require review by People Operations, Legal, and the executive owner when the update affects employee obligations, leave eligibility, benefits access, or employee relations workflows.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002002",
      "document_id": "HR-ADMIN-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "7a5e3a20-eaf8-48e4-962f-0f0467690638",
      "content": "Retention Basics\n\nTeams should retain records according to the retention schedule in their approved system. This public policy does not include detailed legal retention rules or HR investigation outcomes.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002003",
      "document_id": "IT-003",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "f10db009-dee2-4cab-9081-6fc64591228d",
      "content": "Access Notice\n\nThis document is restricted to Sales Representatives, Managers, HR Admins, and IT Admins. It contains internal legal operating guidance and should not be shown to general employees or external parties.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002008",
      "document_id": "LEGAL-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "c3bc1cb5-f4a8-4f8d-a8a2-3006d109d94f",
      "content": "Code of Conduct\n\nEmployees must communicate respectfully, protect confidential information, avoid harassment, and follow company security policies. Concerns about conduct should be reported to a manager, People Operations, or the confidential ethics channel.\n\nThe handbook does not include legal advice, salary bands, compensation formulas, or detailed HR investigation outcomes.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "HR Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "9c765ed4-54be-43ed-a663-8cc12d7ff3b7",
      "content": "Escalation Paths\n\nCases involving discrimination, harassment, retaliation, workplace safety, or executive-level conflicts should be escalated to the Director of People Operations within one business day.\n\nBenefits eligibility disputes should be routed to the benefits specialist. Remote work exceptions involving cross-border work should be reviewed with People Operations and Legal before approval.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002002",
      "document_id": "HR-ADMIN-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "HR Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "c143b1fd-a1a9-41bc-a04c-a340a701051d",
      "content": "Sensitive Case Handling\n\nSensitive employee relations cases must be logged in the HR case system. HR Admins should record the case category, intake source, assigned HR partner, and next review date.\n\nDetailed HR investigation outcomes are not published in the general employee knowledge base and should not be summarized by the knowledge agent for non-HR users.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002002",
      "document_id": "HR-ADMIN-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    }
  ],
